A user can restore a moved run archive atomically — `cw run restore` stages the import then publishes with a single rename, refusing malformed, duplicate-path, reserved-path, or over-limit archives with structured `archive-limit-*`/`archive-malformed` codes and leaving no partial `.cw/runs` state on refusal.
